---
// Quiz figure for the spacing post: two forms drawn at 1px per unit, gaps shaded.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq03formgaps">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 250" role="img" aria-label="Two sign-in forms drawn at real pixel sizes, each with Email and Password fields. Form A: 12px gap under each label and 12px between the two fields. Form B: 4px gap under each label and 24px between the fields. The gaps are shaded.">
<rect x="20" y="10" width="270" height="230" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="34" y="32" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Form A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Form A</tspan></text>
<text x="34" y="63" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Email</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Email</tspan></text>
<rect x="34" y="66" width="242" height="12" class="gap" />
<rect x="34" y="78" width="242" height="32" rx="4" class="fld" />
<rect x="34" y="110" width="242" height="12" class="gap" />
<text x="34" y="135" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Password</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mật khẩu</tspan></text>
<rect x="34" y="138" width="242" height="12" class="gap" />
<rect x="34" y="150" width="242" height="32" rx="4" class="fld" />
<text x="34" y="222" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>label to input: 12px, field to field: 12px</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhãn tới ô nhập: 12px, ô tới ô: 12px</tspan></text>
<rect x="310" y="10" width="270" height="230" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="324" y="32" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Form B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Form B</tspan></text>
<text x="324" y="63" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Email</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Email</tspan></text>
<rect x="324" y="66" width="242" height="4" class="gap" />
<rect x="324" y="70" width="242" height="32" rx="4" class="fld" />
<rect x="324" y="102" width="242" height="24" class="gap" />
<text x="324" y="139" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Password</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mật khẩu</tspan></text>
<rect x="324" y="142" width="242" height="4" class="gap" />
<rect x="324" y="146" width="242" height="32" rx="4" class="fld" />
<text x="324" y="222" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>label to input: 4px, field to field: 24px</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhãn tới ô nhập: 4px, ô tới ô: 24px</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .fld { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .lab { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .gap { fill: var(--gold); opacity: 0.35; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); opacity: 0.55; }
  .qfig-uxq03formgaps .ico { fill: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.7; }
</style>
